in the collection and\nthen added every requested item back, even when the list was unchanged.\nFor non-owned collections such as OrganisationUnit.dataSets and\nOrganisationUnit.programs, each touched item loads and updates its full\nowning collection (DataSet.sources, Program.organisationUnits). On a large\ninstance, re-sending an org unit's unchanged data sets loaded hundreds of\nthousands of org units, took 4 to 9 s, set a new lastUpdated on every data\nset and program, and failed with HTTP 500 when the transaction hit the idle\nin transaction timeout. The Metadata Management app sends these PUTs on\nevery org unit save.\n\nreplaceCollectionItems now compares the current and requested UIDs and\nonly removes and adds the difference, so an unchanged list touches nothing.\nThe collection endpoints also only clear the Hibernate caches when the\nupdate actually changed something.\n\n🤖 AI Assisted","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"d80e9544c78560a2efc0fc440b178e78f0173501","tree_id":"e4180381d7d21fc5ba0d6b1259249d712032e25c","timestamp":"2026-10-04T13:19:46Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.c